            "body": "<p data-local-id=\"4860ac8bb615\">Hello <span data-local-id=\"81a3e571-4f1f-4cb9-9b43-bc7e6ba8b9e3\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"qm:77071153-8149-425d-9cc5-2ef53c35a3bd:7fbd170e-378b-4b15-a44d-4856d507b4dc\">@Colton Neal</span> ,</p><p data-local-id=\"2086e14437ca\">Thank you for your patience on this. We have passed the blank Incident Security ID reports to our engineering team for review.</p><p data-local-id=\"a06d8fe579e4\">In the meantime, if another user shows a blank Incident Security ID, please let us know here and we will set it for them.</p><p data-local-id=\"7da94b5d4d19\">Kind regards,<br>Juan Martinez<br>Appriss Retail Support</p>",
